abstract: >-
  Research software and computational resources supporting physics-guided
  LSTM modeling and synthetic solar irradiance generation for Tumbabiro,
  Ecuador. The repository includes model artifacts, preprocessing and
  validation workflows, a synthetic 2050 solar resource, and NREL SAM/PySAM
  photovoltaic and techno-economic simulation resources.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Vanyakin6307/pg-lstm-solar-resource-2050"
